     "body": "<p>@awoods in terms of debug logging, do you suggest following Sonar's suggestion to \"Guard Debug Logging\" <a href=\"http://sonar.fcrepo.org/drilldown/issues/4666\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://sonar.fcrepo.org/drilldown/issues/4666</a></p>\n\n<p>if (LOGGER.isDebugEnabled()) </p>\n{\r\n    LOGGER.debug(\"foo\");\r\n}\n\n<p>or just do seems to be the existing convention in the f4 codebase (without the guards):</p>\n\n<p>LOGGER.debug(\"foo\");</p>",
     "created": "09/Jan/15 5:08 PM",
